mages%2Fhero%2Fscene-hero.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fscene-hero.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fscene-hero.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fscene-hero.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fscene-hero.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero%2Fscene-hero.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 w-full text-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 md:flex-row md:items-end\"><div><p class=\"mb-5 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">Vietnam · Worldwide</p><h1 class=\"font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,11vw,10rem)] leading-[0.8] tracking-[-0.04em]\">The Scene</h1></div><div class=\"max-w-sm\"><p class=\"font-sans text-sm leading-6 md:text-base\">Intimate weddings and destination stories, photographed and filmed with a quiet, cinematic approach.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 flex items-center gap-4 font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-white/70\"></span><span>Scroll to explore</span></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 py-32 md:px-10 md:py-48\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end\"><div class=\"md:col-span-7\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">The Studio</p><h2 class=\"mt-10 max-w-4xl font-serif text-5xl leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl\">We document the moments that feel like you.</h2></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9\"><p class=\"font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">The Scene Studio creates intimate photographs and films for couples celebrating love in beautiful places.</p><p class=\"mt-6 font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">From quiet ceremonies to unforgettable celebrations, our approach is unobtrusive, cinematic, and deeply personal.</p><p class=\"mt-6 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase\">Based in Vietnam · Available worldwide</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-24 grid md:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#ddd8cf] md:col-span-7 md:col-start-3 md:aspect-[4/3]\"><img alt=\"The Scene Studio wedding photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 58vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstudio%2Fscene-studio.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 pb-32 md:px-10 md:pb-48\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"mb-16 flex items-end justify-between md:mb-24\"><div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">Selected Stories</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-6xl\">Recent celebrations</h2></div><a href=\"/stories\" class=\"hidden font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase transition-opacity hover:opacity-50 md:block\">View all stories →</a></div><div class=\"space-y-24 md:space-y-40\"><article><a href=\"/stories/haley-david\" class=\"group block\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex